1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,480
So I'm class rep this year.

2
00:00:02,630 --> 00:00:05,599
Which apparently means I'm doing the teacher gift.

3
00:00:05,849 --> 00:00:07,842
I pop a message in the class WhatsApp.

4
00:00:07,992 --> 00:00:09,824
Five quid each for Miss Clarke.

5
00:00:10,074 --> 00:00:11,458
Can I give it you Friday?

6
00:00:11,588 --> 00:00:13,306
Is it five or ten?

7
00:00:13,436 --> 00:00:15,360
Ooh, we've already got her something!

8
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:18,328
Eleven thumbs-up. Zero fivers.

9
00:00:18,478 --> 00:00:21,998
Three weeks of 'just a gentle reminder'.

10
00:00:22,128 --> 00:00:24,401
A sandwich bag of coins at the gate.

11
00:00:24,501 --> 00:00:27,127
And I'm still forty quid short…

12
00:00:27,427 --> 00:00:29,158
so guess who's topping it up.

13
00:00:29,558 --> 00:00:30,349
Next year?

14
00:00:30,499 --> 00:00:31,725
One Collection Pot,

15
00:00:31,895 --> 00:00:34,285
one link… and I'm putting the kettle on.

16
00:00:34,685 --> 00:00:35,783
Collection Pot.

17
00:00:35,953 --> 00:00:37,032
Easy to sort.

18
00:00:37,182 --> 00:00:38,607
Impossible to forget.
